<li about="#cite_note-28" id="cite_note-28" data-mw-footnote-number="28"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwCTg"><a href="#cite_ref-28" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwCTk"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwCTo">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-28" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt116" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwCTs" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"cite usenet","href":"./Template:Cite_usenet"},"params":{"last":{"wt":"Murdoch"},"first":{"wt":"Ian"},"date":{"wt":"1993-08-16"},"title":{"wt":"New release under development; suggestions requested"},"url":{"wt":"https://groups.google.com/g/comp.os.linux.development/c/Md3Modzg5TU/m/xty88y5OLaMJ"},"quote":{"wt":"Fellow Linuxers,&lt;br> This is just to announce the imminent completion of a brand-new Linux release, which I&apos;m calling the Debian Linux Release. This is a release that I have put together basically from scratch; in other words, I didn&apos;t simply make some changes to SLS and call it a new release. I was inspired to put together this release after running SLS and generally being dissatisfied with much of it, and after much altering of SLS I decided that it would be easier to start from scratch."}},"i":0}}]}'/><cite id="CITEREFMurdoch1993" class="citation newsgroup cs1" about="#mwt116">Murdoch, Ian (August 16, 1993). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://groups.google.com/g/comp.os.linux.development/c/Md3Modzg5TU/m/xty88y5OLaMJ" class="external text" id="mwCTw">"New release under development; suggestions requested"</a>. <q id="mwCT0">Fellow Linuxers,<br id="mwCT4"/> This is just to announce the imminent completion of a brand-new Linux release, which I'm calling the Debian Linux Release. This is a release that I have put together basically from scratch; in other words, I didn't simply make some changes to SLS and call it a new release. I was inspired to put together this release after running SLS and generally being dissatisfied with much of it, and after much altering of SLS I decided that it would be easier to start from scratch.</q></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=New+release+under+development%3B+suggestions+requested&amp;rft.date=1993-08-16&amp;rft.aulast=Murdoch&amp;rft.aufirst=Ian&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fgroups.google.com%2Fg%2Fcomp.os.linux.development%2Fc%2FMd3Modzg5TU%2Fm%2Fxty88y5OLaMJ&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ADebian" class="Z3988" about="#mwt116" id="mwCT8"></span></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-29" id="cite_note-29" data-mw-footnote-number="29"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwCUA"><a href="#cite_ref-29" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwCUE"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwCUI">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-29" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt119" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwCUM" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"cite usenet","href":"./Template:Cite_usenet"},"params":{"last":{"wt":"Murdoch"},"first":{"wt":"Ian"},"date":{"wt":"1993-08-16"},"title":{"wt":"New release under development; suggestions requested"},"url":{"wt":"https://groups.google.com/g/comp.os.linux.development/c/Md3Modzg5TU/m/xty88y5OLaMJ"},"quote":{"wt":"The base system is now virtually complete (though I&apos;m still looking around to make sure that I grabbed the most recent sources for everything), and I&apos;d like to get some feedback before I add the \"fancy\" stuff.&lt;br> Please note that this release is not yet completed and may not be for several more weeks; however, I thought I&apos;d post now to perhaps draw a few people out of the woodwork."}},"i":0}}]}'/><cite id="mwCUQ" class="citation newsgroup cs1" about="#mwt119" data-x-id="CITEREFMurdoch1993">Murdoch, Ian (August 16, 1993). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://groups.google.com/g/comp.os.linux.development/c/Md3Modzg5TU/m/xty88y5OLaMJ" class="external text" id="mwCUU">"New release under development; suggestions requested"</a>. <q id="mwCUY">The base system is now virtually complete (though I'm still looking around to make sure that I grabbed the most recent sources for everything), and I'd like to get some feedback before I add the "fancy" stuff.<br id="mwCUc"/> Please note that this release is not yet completed and may not be for several more weeks; however, I thought I'd post now to perhaps draw a few people out of the woodwork.</q></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=New+release+under+development%3B+suggestions+requested&amp;rft.date=1993-08-16&amp;rft.aulast=Murdoch&amp;rft.aufirst=Ian&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fgroups.google.com%2Fg%2Fcomp.os.linux.development%2Fc%2FMd3Modzg5TU%2Fm%2Fxty88y5OLaMJ&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ADebian" class="Z3988" about="#mwt119" id="mwCUg"></span></span></li>
